notes: The owner explicitly requested V032 while V031 had not been separately accepted, so V031 remains the previous candidate and V024 / 0_2_4 remains the owner-confirmed passed baseline. V032 adds a PC-pull ESP32-CAM path for the stock Arduino CameraWebServer: PC Studio accepts a private-LAN ESP IPv4 address, probes GET /capture, continuously ingests JPEG snapshots into the existing CameraFrameService pipeline, exposes remote-camera connection status, and provides the ESP :81/stream URL for direct preview. Simulation mode temporarily pauses remote ingestion and resumes it afterward. The existing ESP/Raspberry-Pi POST /api/camera/frame receiver remains backward compatible. Remote camera input does not add public-road signal authority; inference, training, analytics and signal logic remain PC-side prototype functions.
